AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002213> "p positively regulates q iff p regulates q, and p increases the rate or magnitude of execution of q.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002213> "positively regulates"@en)
