# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002216> (capable of part of)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002216> "c stands in this relationship to p if and only if there exists some p' such that c is capable_of p', and p' is part_of p.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002216> "capable of part of"@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002216> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002328>)
