AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002263> "c acts upstream of p if and only if c enables some f that is involved in p' and p' occurs chronologically before p, is not part of p, and affects the execution of p. c is a material entity and f, p, p' are processes.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002263> "acts upstream of")
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002263> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002264>)

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002264> (acts upstream of or within)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002264> "c acts upstream of or within p if c is enables f, and f is causally upstream of or within p. c is a material entity and p is an process.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002264> "acts upstream of or within")
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002264> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002500>)

