# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_35366> (fatty acid)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_35366> "Any aliphatic monocarboxylic acid derived from or contained in esterified form in an animal or vegetable fat, oil or wax. Natural fatty acids commonly have a chain of 4 to 28 carbons (usually unbranched and even-numbered), which may be saturated or unsaturated. By extension, the term is sometimes used to embrace all acyclic aliphatic carboxylic acids.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_35366> "fatty acid")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_35366> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_18059>)
